00:02:03.509 --> 00:02:09.630
You're looking at a not just an invasion through
the East, through the through the Donbass,

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:14.599
but according to the intelligence and intelligence
that we're seeing coming down from the north,

00:02:14.599 --> 00:02:18.840
down from Belarus and actually encircling
Kiev itself as.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:26.540
Speaker 1: Yes, so it's it is the type of
thing that the circumstances are completely

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.790
different than World War Two.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:37.260
But in terms of the scale in European countries,
it would be if it's the worst case scenario.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.569
Clearly the biggest war in Europe since World
War Two.

00:02:40.569 --> 00:02:45.340
Kamala Harris also commenting on this from
the Munich Security Conference over the weekend.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:50.830
Speaker 3: I mean, listen, guys, we're talking
about the potential for war in Europe.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:57.599
I mean, let's really take a moment to understand
the significance of what we're talking about.

00:02:57.599 --> 00:03:02.790
It's been over 70 years and through those
70 years, as I mentioned yesterday, there

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.390
has been peace and security.

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:08.999
We are talking about the real possibility
of war in Europe.

00:03:08.999 --> 00:03:13.110
Speaker 1: Now there has not been total peace
and security in Europe, and we have had a

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:16.500
number of different civil wars within Europe.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:23.719
OK, but the point is clear, which is this
type of large war involving multiple countries

00:03:23.719 --> 00:03:26.499
has not been seen in Europe since World War
Two.

00:03:26.499 --> 00:03:35.099
Speaker 3: So our position is for us very
clear, which is as a leader, which we have

00:03:35.099 --> 00:03:42.099
been bringing together the allies working
together around our collective and unified

00:03:42.099 --> 00:03:50.489
position that we would all not just prefer,
we desire, we believe it is in the best interest

00:03:50.489 --> 00:03:54.180
of all that there is a diplomatic end.

