00:04:07.739 --> 00:04:12.709
But if this were to happen, and I hope it
doesn't, I don't want a war.

00:04:12.709 --> 00:04:15.150
I don't want U.S. troops in Ukraine.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.150
I don't.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.150
I don't.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.150
I don't want any of it.

